<title>CANADA: CBRS reaffirms Agrium debt ratings.</title>
<headline>CBRS reaffirms Agrium debt ratings.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Bond Rating Service said on Tuesday it reaffirmed its ratings of Agrium Inc's private placement debt and commercial paper and assigned an A (low) rating to the firm's proposed senior unsecured debt issues.</p>
<p>CBRS said it kept an A (low) rating on Agrium's private placement debt and A-1 rating on its commerical paper with a stable outlook.</p>
<p>It said the good quality ratings reflected Agrium's position as a low-cost leader in nitrogen fertilizer production.</p>
</text>
